        "input": "2\n5 1\n1 2\n1 3\n2 4\n2 5\n5 2\n1 2\n1 3\n2 4\n2 5",
        "output": "3\n1",
        "explanation": "Explanation:\nTest case 1: Color the node 111 with black color and color the nodes 2,3,4,52, 3, 4, 52,3,4,5 with white color to get the minimum cost of the tree, that is 333, and the maximum value of the tree, that is 333.\nTest case 2: Color the nodes 1,41, 41,4 with black color and color the nodes 2,3,52, 3, 52,3,5 with white color to get the minimum cost of the tree, that is 333, and the minimum value of the tree, that is 111."
